  "body": "**Instant startup**\n\n### Highlights\n\n- New sessions paint their first frame in about 20ms instead of about 135ms, and the screen no longer shifts while connecting\n- Opening several sessions in quick succession is fast again, and resuming large sessions is about three times quicker\n- New post_tool_feedback hook feeds a script's output back to the model after each tool call, and post_tool hooks now receive the tool input, call id, and touched paths\n\n### Improvements\n\n- The jcode: model prefix and JCODE_OPENROUTER_MODEL are honored, and jcode run fails clearly when --model cannot be applied\n- Onboarding predicts your default provider and model from existing logins\n- Expired status notices clear on their own without waiting for a keypress\n- Old build binaries and stale scratch files are pruned automatically\n- Web search hints no longer recommend the retired Bing Search API\n- jcode builds on FreeBSD\n\n### Fixes\n\n- New sessions no longer show \"Waiting for reload handoff\" right after a reload\n- --provider-profile works with Anthropic-compatible profiles\n- Copy selections that end inside a wide character include that character\n- The warning gate fails closed on cargo check errors and prints the diagnostics\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/1jehuang/jcode/compare/v0.92.0...v0.93.0\n\n<!-- jcode-platform-availability:start -->\n## Platform availability\n\n- Linux x86_64: available\n- Linux aarch64: available\n- macOS Apple Silicon: available\n- macOS Intel: available\n- Windows x86_64: available\n- Windows ARM64: available\n- FreeBSD x86_64: available\n<!-- jcode-platform-availability:end -->\n\n<!-- jcode-discord-announced:v0.93.0 -->\n"
}
